  "workflows": {},
  "implementation_policy": "MuJoCo free 6-DOF chassis with two passive hinge axles and four rigid wheels. Five physical counterfactuals: half/double initial speed with matching wheel spin, high contact friction from frame 1, true deletion of the car and wheels, and a native track-friction change at frame 8 (7/24 s) without pose or velocity resets. Source and edits share the same visual template, camera, quality and real-time playback; native out-of-frame trajectories are retained in annotations. Cycles persistent data is disabled to retain the wheel-flicker fix.",
